# Production Database (PostgreSQL - Supabase / Neon / AWS RDS)
# If left commented or blank, the backend automatically defaults to local SQLite (data/ayush.db)
# Example Supabase: postgresql://postgres.[project-ref]:[password]@aws-0-[region].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?sslmode=require
# Example Neon: postgresql://[user]:[password]@[endpoint].neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
